# Networking

In the forum-iOS checkout, read `docs/networking.md` before changing REST or Socket code.

- New REST endpoints: `APIRequest` value types under `API/Forum/Requests/`, send via `ForumAPIClient.shared`
- Realtime: `ForumSocket` + `EventIdentifiable` / `SocketOutgoingEvent`; fan-out via delegates
- Live-room socket side effects belong in `SessionSocketEventHandler` (see `docs/session.md`), not duplicated in `ForumSocket`
